g with this  the movies however are where things are  going to go down but on top of that they  are going to have specific disney plus  shows that address a lot of things  happening in the mcu secret invasion is  a perfect example and we'll talk about  that in a bit but one thing i need you  to keep in mind is that this is a new  saga and we are now in the building  phase once more when the mcu originally  started it had to build they built up to  the avengers and while yes there was  some connectivity there it's not like  thor himself was name-dropping captain  america and iron man point being they  had to build then once they had the  first avengers film that's where  everything seemed to be really really  connected well that's kind of where we  are right now and honestly things are  about to get really really exciting i've  seen the first two episodes of miss  marvel and i can personally tell you  that there are so many easter eggs and  miss marvel and so much connectivity to  the mcu so that feeling of things not  being connected is about to go away big  time especially if you look at some key  projects coming up let's go through them  and we're going to start with like i  said miss marvel and she hulk now in  miss marvel and they showed this in the  trailer so it's not a spoiler they go to  avengers con so as you can imagine there  is a lot of easter eggs there and a lot  of connectivity so that's really cool  then in she-hulk we are going to see  wong which has been confirmed we've  already seen abomination and rumor has  it right now that we're going to see  daredevil which is really really awesome  and very expected because daredevil is  getting his own disney plus series plus  he's going to be appearing in the echo  series and in the echo series we're  going to be getting like i mentioned  daredevil but also kingpin so already  with those shows right there that's a  lot of connectivity happening and that's  just disney plus shows now of course  miss marvel 