  it's going to completely shift it we're  about to have an insanely awesome team  in the mcu and the world's smartest man  and the cool thing about the fantastic  four is they can do battle on earth but  they can also be a cosmic team as well  which brings us to the cosmic side of  the mcu which is the marvels which i  already talked about but don't forget  about guardians of the galaxy vol 3 and  nova nova is confirmed to be coming to  the mcu and it looks like since this is  going to be the last guardians of the  galaxy film from james gunn and most of  the cast it looks like the guardians are  going to be set up as an official team  an official team of protecting the  galaxy where characters can actually be  interchanged so after guardians 3 we're  not going to have the original team but  hopefully some characters will stay like  star-lord and hopefully they get some  new ones like nova and adam warlock and  other really awesome characters then of  course we have loki season 2 coming in  this is where things are going to get  really really interesting kevin feige  confirmed that the only way the events  of spider-man know a home could play out  in the events of doctor strange and the  multiverse of madness and anything else  multiverse that is up and coming these  events were only allowed to happen  because of what happened in loki season  1. if loki and sylvie hadn't have killed  he who remains the tva would have  stepped in and stopped all of this from  happening so loki season 2 is going to  be extremely important not only for the  sacred timeline and the multiverse but  also for another introduction of kang  the conqueror and then of course we have  movies like captain america 4 coming up  and this could be the start of the new  avengers team which obviously would have  a lot of connections and last but  certainly not least we have blade coming  up and this is going to be the start of  kind of our monster side of the mcu well  really moon night was the start of it  but blade is going to take this even  further and hopefully be the start of  the introduction of the midnight suns  team and i am personally really really  excited for that to finally happen in  the mcu so as you can see here there's a  lot of really really exciting stuff  coming up for the mcu and if you've been  worried about the connectivity i hope  this video has helped you at least a  little bit but let me know what you  think about the future of the mcu in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe so you don't  miss out on any of the future marvel  videos for live updates you can follow  me on instagram and twitter and as  always thank you all so much for  watching woof  you

